323454c919623af0829deb769032394eb5cb01be3ab60ce4333237"}, "model_called": true, "reported_model": "deepseek-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 1956, "completion_tokens": 299, "total_tokens": 2255, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1792}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 1792, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 164}, "answer_attempts": 2, "answer_attempt_seconds": [3.366, 3.608], "answer_format_errors": [], "planner_action": null, "planner_error": null, "planner_validation_errors": [], "followup_query": null, "followup_versions": ["FIN-001-v2", "MGT-003-v1"], "followup_chunks": ["d7318c95d4323454c919623af0829deb769032394eb5cb01be3ab60ce4333237"], "conflict_followup": "used_relation"}, "response": {"status": "report_conflict", "answer": "两份制度对同一情形规定了不同标准，且现有证据未给出优先适用规则，无法确定唯一金额：\n\n- 《员工日常业务执行标准》（V1.0）第二条规定，境内出差且接待方未提供餐食时，伙食补助为100元/人/自然日；接待方已提供餐食的当日不再领取伙食补助。[E1]\n- 《员工差旅报销管理制度》（V2.0）第六条规定，境内出差伙食补助为80元/人/自然日；接待方已提供餐食的当日不再领取伙食补助。[E2] 该制度第四章执行标准对照表 T01 也列明普通员工、部门经理、高级管理人员的伙食补助均为80元/日。[E3]\n\n关于适用关系：《员工日常业务执行标准》第五条明确其为公司级内部管理制度，自2026年10月1日起施行，公司既有差旅等专项制度继续保留，该文件不作废止、替代或优先适用的决定，制度调整以另行批准发布的文件为准。[E11] 因此，截至查询日2026-10-17，不能依据现有证据判定80元还是100元优先适用，需由制度发布或授权部门明确两份制度的适用关系后再行确定。", "as_of_date": "2026-10-17", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "E1", "chunk_id": "4bd4470df9e9be97ac151b7bedad182251255826c95545a6a63e84b6c68201ff", "document_id": "MGT-003", "version_id": "MGT-003-v1", "title": "员工日常业务执行标准", "version": "1.0", "sections": ["第二章 执行标准"], "clause_numbers": [2, 3, 4], "source_format": "md", "locations": [{"page_start": null, "page_end": null, "paragraph_index": null, "line_start": 13, "line_end": 13, "table_index": null}, {"page_start": null, "page_end": null, "paragraph_index": null, "line_start": 15, "line_end": 15, "table_index": null}, {"page_start": null, "page_end": null, "paragraph_index": null, "line_start": 17, "line_end": 17, "table_index": null}]}, {"evidence_id": "E2", "chunk_id": "92fc6d21665aa6f13ad803517e2113142a849e2b3780491b9d5f1ac91e049bc9", "document_id": "FIN-001"