fab10d761c04349232bde988", "E9": "de60157be9e3733c3ba66e4116f7680de37e8c24f9c60fd56cc7ea466fa69d03", "E10": "a2d6ce705daf959f28ff31c4f878e4718aeb638d340a9ba121affa577f2ef0ac", "E11": "d7318c95d4323454c919623af0829deb769032394eb5cb01be3ab60ce4333237"}, "model_called": true, "reported_model": "deepseek-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 1769, "completion_tokens": 303, "total_tokens": 2072, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 1536}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 1536, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 233}, "answer_attempts": 2, "answer_attempt_seconds": [4.124, 3.505], "answer_format_errors": [], "planner_action": null, "planner_error": null, "planner_validation_errors": [], "followup_query": null, "followup_versions": ["MGT-003-v1", "SEC-002-v2"], "followup_chunks": ["d7318c95d4323454c919623af0829deb769032394eb5cb01be3ab60ce4333237"], "conflict_followup": "used_relation"}, "response": {"status": "report_conflict", "answer": "现有证据对账号密码最低长度存在两处不同规定，且无法依据证据判定优先关系：\n\n1. 《公司账号与密码管理制度》（V2.0）第三条规定账号密码长度至少12位，须包含大写字母、小写字母、数字和特殊字符中的至少3类 [E1]；同制度执行标准对照表T01也列明密码长度至少12位 [E2]。该版本自2026-09-15起施行，原V1.0自生效日起废止 [E8]。\n\n2. 《员工日常业务执行标准》（V1.0）第四条规定公司业务系统账号密码的最低长度为16位，须包含大写字母、小写字母、数字和特殊字符中的至少3类 [E3]。该制度自2026年10月1日起施行，其附则明确公司既有账号专项制度继续保留，本文件不作废止、替代或优先适用的决定 [E11]。\n\n因此，截至查询日期2026-10-17，12位与16位两种规定同时有效，证据未提供解决冲突的优先适用规则，无法确认应以哪一个为准。建议由制度发布部门明确账号密码专项制度与《员工日常业务执行标准》的适用关系。", "as_of_date": "2026-10-17", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "E1", "chunk_id": "4fe729af35686d43a799c182881c50a665ca842c631f5416fac6bcbb13f88d93", "document_id": "SEC-002", "version_id": "SEC-002-v2", "title": "公司账号与密码管理制度", "version": "2.0", "sections": ["第二章 标准与控制"], "clause_numbers": [3, 4], "source_format": "md", "locations": [{"page_start": null, "page_end": null, "paragraph_index": null, "line_start": 15, "line_end": 15, "table_index": null}, {"page_start": null, "page_end": null, "paragraph_index": null, "line_start": 17, "line_end": 17, "table_index": null}]}, {"evidence_id": "E2", "chunk_id": "2bb96ddd59f9f60d44a62365